# KN-006: Filtration distinguishes a soluble enzyme from a solid catalyst
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 MnO2 0.001mol
new
filter v1 v2
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 catalase 0.000000000004mol
new
filter v3 v4
add v2 H2O2 0.001mol
add v4 H2O2 0.001mol
wait 0.001s
inspect
